      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but it feels like more than just 'efficiency' or metabolism stuff. like, it’s almost like my brain is operating on a different frequency than the average person. i don't feel 'stressed' or like i'm compensating, i just feel... optimized. like i'm seeing the world in high definition while everyone else is seeing it in standard def. do you think there's any research into people who are just naturally part of a more advanced evolutionary tier? like, a biological outlier group?",
